   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Sustainable Tourism in Mongolia through UNESCO Cultural and</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promote Mongolia&apos;s post-Covid resilience of sustainable tourism through the country&apos;s cultural and geo heritage. It will help both UNESCO-designated sites to be better managed and promoted for sustainable tourism while ensuring that the surrounding communities benefit from tourism development. The project will eventually contribute to the sustainable development of UNESCO Sites and safeguarding of the endangered living heritage.</narrative>
  </description>
